Package: devjam-external-keyring-legacy
Version: 1.1-1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: OpenPGP keys for external apt repositories (legacy)
 Signing keys of third-party apt repositories, installed in
 /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d for Debian Live images that still use
 sources.list without Signed-By. Use devjam-external-keyring on other
 systems; this package will be dropped once Debian Live handles
 deb822 .sources files.
